    (0xd7238, 'function', 'ObjCollisionProximityUpdate', 'ObjCollisionProximityUpdate [low] 3.6 KB; decrements cooldown byte o+28h, reads owner [o+8] pos (+120h) and rot matrix (+130h) -> quaternion via trace branches, measures distances between collision shapes (CollisionShapeGetWorldPos + F_2393c0) under PauseSpin_170A7C/170B2C/170C24 spin locks, static-init table 3AE7AC0h; callers F_2086e8, F_5738f8, F_31f764 | sig: void ObjCollisionProximityUpdate(void *o, void *, bool *outFlag) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0xd80b0, 'function', 'CollisionObjectUpdate', 'CollisionObjectUpdate [medium] per-object collision update run by KIDSTS[s9:CollisionUpdate] x9 (~1 core total): std::map red-black-tree traversals (pointer chasing, algorithmic not a spin) [Ghidra: 1605 B, 1 callers] | sig: void CollisionObjectUpdate(void* obj, void* ctx, uint64_t index) | src: notes/cpu-profile.md §TL;DR; §Threads; re/scripts_workers/g_coll.txt'),
    (0xd8180, 'label', 'CollisionObjectUpdate_LoopHead', 'CollisionObjectUpdate_LoopHead [high] Loop head of CollisionObjectUpdate (i = start, start+5 ...): mov rcx,[r10+150h] (49 8B 8A 50 01 00 00); r10 = mgr, r13 = i. Patch CP (jmp to a prefetch cave, patcher/collprefetch_live.fsx); rax/rcx/flags proven dead here | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §2; patcher/collprefetch_live.fsx'),
    (0xd8291, 'label', 'CollisionObjectUpdate_OwnerRecMiss', 'CollisionObjectUpdate_OwnerRecMiss [high] hot RIP (25 % of D80B0 self, PC): first touch of the owner record (D8D90 result) +10Fh | src: notes/collision-opt.md'),
    (0xd83f4, 'label', 'CB_DL_Site', 'CB_DL_Site [high] CollisionObjectUpdate first CollisionPartMapFind call (per part); dead when the global-owner path (sil, r11) re-searches at D841F. Patch DL (collbook_live.fsx) | src: notes/collision-opt.md'),
