    (0xd867b, 'label', 'CB_CS1_Site', 'CB_CS1_Site [high] owner[+110h] = owner[+10Fh] (prev = cur state), stored for every collider of the owner by all 5 jobs. Patch CS (conditional store) | src: notes/collision-opt.md'),
