    (0xd8740, 'function', 'CollisionPartMapFind', 'CollisionPartMapFind [high] lower_bound on a sorted array of 16-byte {u64 key = part pointer, ptr record} at [m+10h], count [m+18h]; returns the record if the key matches, else null. Called per part per frame from CollisionObjectUpdate (D83F4, D841F); ~0.08 core on PC (profiled as D8700(leaf?)). Candidate SH (hinted search) | sig: void* CollisionPartMapFind(PartMap* m, void* part) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §6'),
