    (0xd89e0, 'function', 'CollisionIsBeyondDistance', 'CollisionIsBeyondDistance [low] returns true if element i is farther than max(16000,[+0x98])+radius from the view position at g_CollisionWorld+0x1B10 [Ghidra: 323 B, 4 callers] | src: re/scripts_workers/g_coll.txt'),
    (0xd8b24, 'function', 'CollisionTlsStaticGet_46D7AD0', 'CollisionTlsStaticGet_46D7AD0 [medium] Thread-safe static-init guard (TLS epoch vs [46D7AC4]) returning &46D7AD0; CollisionIsBeyondDistance calls it and ignores the result | sig: void* CollisionTlsStaticGet_46D7AD0(void) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §6'),
    (0xd8b70, 'function', 'CollisionShapeGetWorldPos', 'CollisionShapeGetWorldPos [high] description fix: no std::map; position from the type-byte (+62h) function table 3BE3780 (2 types inlined: 2D9EE0 transform at +B0h, copy of +80h), plus parent (+68h) double position at +210h..+220h via 3CD840. Hot RIP D8B7E (96 %) = first touch of the part | sig: f32* CollisionShapeGetWorldPos(Part* p, f32* out4) | src: notes/collision-opt.md'),
    (0xd8d90, 'function', 'CollisionOwnerArrayFind', 'CollisionOwnerArrayFind [high] was CollisionMapFind: NOT a std::map - lower_bound over a flat sorted array of 16-byte {u32 key, pad, Owner*} at [h+180h], count [h+188h]; returns the Owner* on an exact match. Called once per collider by CollisionObjectUpdate (owner key = +0Ch ? +0Ch : +08h) | sig: Owner* CollisionOwnerArrayFind(void* h, u32 key) | src: notes/collision-opt.md'),
    (0xd8e00, 'function', 'PlaceableCollisionUpdate', "PlaceableCollisionUpdate [medium] 5.8 KB, called from PlaceableVisibilityUpdate on KIDSTS StageUpdate: rebuilds the placeable's collision lists (CollisionMapFind, 'list too long'), takes the collision write lock D9C38 (spin256 Sleep(0) lock) | sig: void PlaceableCollisionUpdate(Placeable* p, ptr ctx) | src: notes/cpu-hotspots-ally.md §spin256; notes/worker-jobs-opt.md; notes/perf-coverage.md"),
