    (0xda6e0, 'function', 'PlaceableFlag27Check', 'PlaceableFlag27Check [low] Checks [45CE800] mode, p+B8h bit 27, p+109h == FF and the p+C8h range, then 588EF8 / 588F48; hot RIP DA71F = first touch of p+B8h | sig: bool PlaceableFlag27Check(void* unused, Placeable* p) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §3'),
    (0xda7c0, 'function', 'IsEventScene', 'IsEventScene [low] 19-byte bool (121 callers); when true ApplyGraphicsSettings uses 0.5 landscape scale and EVENT_QUALITY logic; meaning inferred | sig: bool IsEventScene(void) | src: re/out/anchors.md §site 0x39a758'),
    (0xda830, 'function', 'PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker', 'PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker [medium] StageUpdate worker called by PlaceableVisibilityUpdate 567A48: two bit-vector passes over world+1668h/+1680h shape lists, then a loop over EVERY entry of the stage placeable map [r15+180h] (16-byte {key, placeable*}) running PlaceableDistanceLod / PlaceableFlag27Check / DBB90 per placeable; hot RIP DB928 = first touch of the placeable | sig: void PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker(Ctx* c, Job* j) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §3'),
    (0xdb8bf, 'label', 'PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker_MapLoop', 'PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker_MapLoop [high] Placeable map loop body start: mov rax,[rel g_CollisionWorld] (48 8B 05 92 E5 4D 04); rbx = entry, r14 = end. Patch SPF (prefetch cave, patcher/stageprefetch_live.fsx); rsi/flags proven dead | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §3; patcher/stageprefetch_live.fsx'),
    (0xdba70, 'function', 'PlaceableDistanceLod', 'PlaceableDistanceLod [high] -1 if null; else d = |p+80h - pos| - 0.5*|(p+90h..98h)*(p+70h..78h)| clamped >= 0; returns -1 if d*d >= 1e6 else -2 (two sqrt); 0.06 core on PC, mostly the first touch of p+70h..98h | sig: i8 PlaceableDistanceLod(void* unused, const f32* pos, Placeable* p) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §3'),
    (0xdbb90, 'function', 'PlaceableUpdateDetail', 'PlaceableUpdateDetail [low] Per-placeable detail update from PlaceableVisibilityUpdateWorker when [c+8] and p+10Dh == 0; reads the p+B0h object | sig: void PlaceableUpdateDetail(Ctx* c, Placeable* p, void* r13) | src: notes/worker-jobs-opt.md §3'),
    (0xdd570, 'function', 'HashIndexFindRecordD8', 'HashIndexFindRecordD8 [high] 182 B; linear-probing (key,index) pairs in vector [t+20h]+8..+10h, hash DE31D8, empty-key sentinel +4; returns t->data+8+idx*D8h or null; 90 callers incl. PlaceableUpdateDetail, PlaceableVisibilityUpdateRange; was Unknown_HashFind_DD570 | sig: Record *HashIndexFindRecordD8(Table *t, int key) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0xdd728, 'function', 'Bitset10Test_At0C', 'Bitset10Test_At0C [high] bitset<10>::test(i) on words at +0xC (false when i >= 10); callers CharacterUpdateStep and character logic (was Unknown_Generic_dd728) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u2-renames.tsv (decomp review)'),
    (0xdd7ac, 'function', 'PlaceableCullSmallByFrustumDistance', 'PlaceableCullSmallByFrustumDistance [medium] 683 B: when p+1E9h and visible, with flag bits 0Ah/25h set in b+B8h (FB7080): lazily fetches bounds once (obj vfunc +F0h, flag 1Bh, radius -> b+C8h); for objects without a resident model (obj+158h ->+28h ->+2CDh) whose AABB is < 1000 on every axis, sets cull bit 2 (E3F860) if the box (+2 pad) fails the camera frustum test (165B34) or its closest point is > 1000 units (1e6 squared) from the camera (1659E0 ->+10h); returns visible && !bit2; callers PlaceableUpdateDetail / PlaceableVisibilityUpdateRange; was Unknown_Placeable_DD7AC | sig: char PlaceableCullSmallByFrustumDistance(Placeable* p, Bounds* b, ptr, ptr, Obj* obj, char visible) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
