    (0xe07c0, 'function', 'ExpandU16ToU32Array', 'ExpandU16ToU32Array [low] vectorized widen of r8d u16 elements to u32 (16-wide loop plus tail) (was Unknown_SimdConvertRange_E07C0) | sig: void Unknown_SimdConvertRange_E07C0(void) | src: re/scripts_re/perf_coverage.py --self unnamed list + decomp D:/nioh3-re/decomp (cpu100-b, decompile-reviewed)'),
    (0xe08a0, 'function', 'AudioVoiceMixQueuedBuffers', 'AudioVoiceMixQueuedBuffers [medium] 6.3 KB; on the audio mix thread (AudioMixThreadProc -> 361428 -> here); consumes a ring of 58h-byte queued buffers (v+88h base, cap +90h, head +94h, count +98h; alt path v+68h), per-channel buffers [v+58h] processed by 3847xxx DSP helpers / 38508F0 / 18BCCC mix (gain, resample) and Memcpy; frame limit min(p4,p5) when v+28h & 24h | sig: bool AudioVoiceMixQueuedBuffers(Voice *v, void *dst, u32 ch, u32 frames, u32 maxFrames, float *gains, bool p7) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0xe1740, 'function', 'AudioBiquadProcess', 'AudioBiquadProcess [medium] virtual; direct-form biquad: coefficients f+8..+18h (b0,b1,b2,a1,a2), per-channel 2-sample history at f+24h (8 bytes per channel, up to f+1Ch channels), interleaved in/out with stride = channels; mono goes to 214A40; was Unknown_E1740 | sig: void AudioBiquadProcess(Biquad* f, u32 channels, float* io, u32 frames) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0xe1bb0, 'function', 'AudioMixBufferZeroOrFill', 'AudioMixBufferZeroOrFill [low] memsets the mix buffer ([p+1F8h], [p+1F4h]*[[p+8]+24h]*4 bytes) when there is no source, else uploads the 0x39-dword block p+270h through the COM-style object [p+200h] and copies; neighbour of AudioVoiceMixQueuedBuffers; vtable only | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-4)'),
