    (0xe2050, 'function', 'AudioEffectChainProcess', 'AudioEffectChainProcess [low] caller of E2340 per-effect process; only caller 36044C; 7.6 % inclusive on the audio thread | sig: void AudioEffectChainProcess(...) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md Addendum audio/objupdate'),
