    (0xe5394, 'function', 'ConvReverbProcess', 'ConvReverbProcess [medium] FIFO-chunks input into a 3-block ring and runs ConvReverbPartitionMac per channel once a full block is queued; only skips when BOTH previous and target wet gain < 0.0001 (iVar7==2); never checks for silent input | sig: u64 ConvReverbProcess(float** ch, u32 frames, ReverbFx* fx, ConvIR* ir, ConvState* st) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md Addendum audio/objupdate'),
    (0xe5840, 'function', 'ConvReverbPartitionMac', 'ConvReverbPartitionMac [medium] partitioned FFT convolution step: copies n floats, zero-pads to 2n, forward FFT (E7840), stores spectrum in the frequency-domain delay line (ring index param_7), then complex multiply-accumulate of param_8 partitions against the IR spectrum (E5EA0) per channel; 4.4 % of a core in cpuprof-r9; was Unknown_Thread5892_E5840 | sig: void ConvReverbPartitionMac(u32 n, ...) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md Addendum audio/objupdate'),
