    (0xe7840, 'function', 'AudioFft2N', 'AudioFft2N [low] forward FFT of size 2n used by the convolution reverb; core kernel E7D00 | sig: void AudioFft2N(u32 n2, ...) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md Addendum audio/objupdate'),
