    (0xecf24, 'function', 'ObjTriggerCollectChildNodes', 'ObjTriggerCollectChildNodes [low] from ObjScriptHashTriggerScan: adds each child of the source container to the target list, then for children of type 0x2C012245 not yet in the scene list registers them and runs 0xED08C / 0x2E9DAA0 on their +0x28 object (was Unknown_Job_ecf24) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u2-renames.tsv (decomp review)'),
