    (0xf0350, 'function', 'UiMenu_DispatchPadInput', 'UiMenu_DispatchPadInput [medium] if vfunc158 active: for pad buttons 0x24/0x17/0x30/0x6E/0x27/100 pressed (560C68) or combos (560C24) calls handler vfuncs 0x1A0..0x1E8, more for confirm/cancel; base method shared by ~70 menu vtables (decompile-verified, cpu100-u1) (was Unknown_Generic_f0350) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u1-renames.tsv'),
