    (0x111184, 'function', 'JobNodeExecute', 'JobNodeExecute [medium] Scheduler0 job runner (up to 38 % of its inclusive samples, everything it runs is below it): unless the cancel bit 80000000h of the state word j+38h is set, runs the job callback through JobInvokeTimed (or the 8FE5FC root path), bumps the run counter j+34h, flags j+24h bit 0 and completes via 11126C; a cancelled node completes, is released (3250F08) and wakes waiters (367B1C on owner+48h); 0 direct callers (vtable); was Unknown_Sched_111184 | sig: u64 JobNodeExecute(JobNode* j) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
