    (0x1e8058, 'function', 'TexViewIsCurrent', 'TexViewIsCurrent [low] 77 B predicate: false if [v+68h]+12Eh; true when not +160h and d+74F0h exists and either +158h is clear or (+140h == d+74F0h and +148h == [d+74F0h]+8); callers DrawEmit, DrawStateBindResourceSlot; was Unknown_StateCommit_1E8058 | sig: bool TexViewIsCurrent(View* v, Dev* d) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0x1e80b0, 'function', 'DrawEmit', 'DrawEmit [high] draw emitter once per draw per sub-pass (17.5% incl, 6.1-6.6% self): state compared vs cached shadow (ctx+0x2550...), tokens 0x3D/0x3B/0x14/0x13/0x17/0x85/0x0B/0x3C written to ctx+0x3C40, binds params 1E6664, meshlet residency check (A3), refcount swap ctx+0x1A80 (lock inc/xadd x2), FindParam WritePositionBuffer/ControlPointMeshDeformation/SoftBody, then DrawSubmit 1D2F60; body 10863 B (aka DrawItemPrepare) || also: #2 main-thread hotspot (3.9% self): per-draw preparation; does an `xor eax,eax; lock cmpxchg [m],0` atomic load once per draw (A3 site 1E835B) [Ghidra: 10863 B, 6 callers] | Draw emitter: per-draw state filtering and token recording (called twice from DrawEmitSubPasses) | src: notes/mainthread-drawprep.md §1 + §2 F/Minor; notes/cpu-profile.md §Top 30 self functions; patcher/mainthread_live.fsx; re/scripts_draw/dis_1DC2F0.txt; notes/mainthread-drawprep.md'),
