    (0x1e82ee, 'label', 'DrawEmit_HotMissB', 'DrawEmit_HotMissB [medium] hot RIP after a per-draw/per-material data load (cache miss) | src: notes/mainthread-drawprep.md §1'),
    (0x1e835b, 'label', 'DrawEmit_MeshletResidencyLoad', 'DrawEmit_MeshletResidencyLoad [high] A3: per-draw atomic-load idiom on meshlet entry flags (rcx=[rbx+16A338h]+idx*0x20; edx zeroed 1E8359, eax 1E834C) -> 8B 01 66 90 (mov eax,[rcx]) (aka DrawItemPrepare_AtomicLoadA3) || also: mainthread_live patch A3: `lock cmpxchg [rcx],edx` used as an atomic load (eax=0) -> plain `mov eax,[m]` + nop (same length); drops a full fence per read | sig: lock cmpxchg [rcx],edx | src: re/scripts_cpu/mainthread_patches.fsx; re/scripts_cpu/lock_misc.txt; patcher/mainthread_live.fsx'),
