    (0x1f5c2c, 'function', 'ShadowCascadeRender', 'ShadowCascadeRender [high] per cascade (535188 loops 1+2) or per VSM tile/batch (1F8340): meshlet culling (9AC33C/52E424, MeshletInstanceCulling 53FD3C, MeshletPreculling 5301FC, end 53007C) then DrawListWalk of list A (slots 2-5, two sub-passes) and list B (slots 11-14, when p26==0); baked path when p25 and bit(cascade) of b2+EA0h; 3278 B | sig: void (SceneR*, ?, Base* b, ..., u32 view(p5), ..., Obj* bakedObj(p17), ..., u8 skipListB(p26), ..., u32 cascade(p32), u8 vsm(p33), u8 vsmTile(p34), ...) | src: notes/shadows-culling.md §1.2'),
