    (0x1f7960, 'function', 'VsmTilesPerFrameBudget', 'VsmTilesPerFrameBudget [high] env param 0x93BCE2C1 (type 0x4000000) or 16; ApplyShadowQuality sets that param per SHADOW_QUAL: 2 (LIGHTEST, LIGHT) / 8 (STANDARD..HIGHEST) | sig: u32 (ParamList* p) | src: notes/work-deciders.md §3'),
