    (0x1f80c8, 'function', 'VsmTileIsEmpty', "VsmTileIsEmpty [high] true when the tile's GPU caster stamp TileList+38h[toroidal idx] is 0 (no casters); clear loop then marks it valid without drawing (149468(..,0) @1F886B), both render loops skip it. Was VsmTileNeedsRender (meaning inverted) | sig: bool (PageMgr* pm, TileList* l, u32* tile) | src: notes/shadows-redundancy.md §1"),
