    (0x1f8340, 'function', 'VsmClipmapRender', 'VsmClipmapRender [high] CPU per-tile VSM path, only when base+1AC678 == 5 (markers VirtualShadowmap, Clipmap %d, Clear Tile %d %d, Batch Tiles %d, Tile %d %d); returns early for modes 1 and 6; renders dirty+requested+uncached tiles up to VsmTilesPerFrameBudget via ShadowCascadeRender; 5021 B | sig: void (SceneR*, Args* a) | src: notes/shadows-culling.md §1.3'),
