    (0x1fdc1c, 'function', 'ResGetSubEntryAddRef', 'ResGetSubEntryAddRef [low] 347 B; if resource [r] is ready (vfunc 58h / +56h, +8 == -1, vfunc 40h) returns entry idx of vector +B0h..+B8h (stride 18h) with refcount +10h incremented, else null (releases via 1FEB74); 15 callers; was Sched0Hot_1FDC1C | sig: Ref *ResGetSubEntryAddRef(Res **r, Ref *out, u64 p3, u64 idx) | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-2)'),
    (0x1febe0, 'function', 'ResourceLoadTakePending', 'ResourceLoadTakePending [medium] moves up to n pending requests (n = cap - active, at most pending) into the active set; called by 1FEE28 under the manager mutexes | sig: void ResourceLoadTakePending(Mgr* m, size_t n, Vec* out) | src: notes/loading.md'),
    (0x1fedc8, 'function', 'ResourceLoadListEraseRange', 'ResourceLoadListEraseRange [medium] MSVC vector::erase(first,last): moves [last,end) down (5CF090), destroys the tail (5CEFE0), stores the new end; only caller ResourceLoadIdlePoll (cpu100-u0, decompile-read) (was Unknown_VectorRangeMove_1FEDC8) | sig: void ResourceLoadListEraseRange(void) | src: decomp D:/nioh3-re/decomp + callers/callees/neighbours in symbols.tsv (cpu100-u0)'),
    (0x1fee28, 'function', 'ResourceLoadIdlePoll', 'ResourceLoadIdlePoll [high] manager A poll (job 1343720): pending [m+200h]+[m+210h], active vector [m+230h..+238h) 16-B entries; takes min(pending, cap - active), cap = GameMain+4Dh ? 1 : 10 (1FEE80); steps active requests (vfunc +30h done, 1FF1E4 ready, vfunc +10h step); Sleep(1) when idle (1FEE68), wake pool 1 + Sleep(1) after a pass without progress (1FF18C) | sig: void ResourceLoadIdlePoll(Mgr* m, Ctx* c) | src: notes/loading.md'),
