    (0x1fee80, 'label', 'ResourceLoadInflightCap', 'ResourceLoadInflightCap [high] r15 = in-flight request cap = GameMain+4Dh ? 1 : 10 (manager A); LoadStats logs the cap per load | sig: call 7F50D4; neg al; sbb r15,r15; and r15,-9; add r15,0Ah | src: notes/loading.md'),
