    (0x1ffe64, 'function', 'IsFlag56SetAnd69Clear', 'IsFlag56SetAnd69Clear [high] leaf: return byte o+56h != 0 && byte o+69h == 0; vtable 3A9A2A8; leaf (no .pdata) (was Unknown_NotAFunction_1FFE64) | sig: bool (ptr o) | src: re/scripts_re/leaf_ranges.py + capstone disasm of the leaf (cpu100-nf)'),
    (0x2002d4, 'function', 'ResourceLoadTaskStateStep', 'ResourceLoadTaskStateStep [medium] 8.9 KB state machine on [task+0Ch] (-1 = idle, 0, 11h ...), uses ResourceIsReady, AtomicBitLockAcquire, SharedObj_ReleaseRef and GetResItem family; vtbl 38FD188 slot +10h (checked in the dump). LIVE: only from ResourceLoadIdlePoll+2B0h (manager A poll) on one loader thread, 8.7 M calls, 75-90 k/s at the title and first load (peak 2.3 M/s), last hit 2.5 min after launch - none in any later load (mission, boss gate, return): a boot/first-load task type | src: notes/session-2026-10-08-perf.md s3 (FnProbe live, captures/playsession/20261008-2059-session)'),
