    (0x232178, 'function', 'CharacterTimedDataTriggerTick', 'CharacterTimedDataTriggerTick [low] 861 B, caller 0x1620EC: decrements timer c+0x6A0 by f+0x14/f+0x10 when not paused (46518 -> GameMain+0x588), looks up a record by type byte c+0x678 in g_DataMgr+0x410 (2324F0), on first frame (c+0x679) notifies model c+0x20, sub-object c+0x9F0 and type-4 attachments (c+0x3B0 list), and when the c+0x668 gate fires triggers rec (value rec[4], id rec[3]/rec[6], kind 0x25 adds stat +0x43C) then reloads timer from rec[3]; Is30Fps branches (was Unknown_MotionTimerStep_232178) | sig: void CharacterTimedDataTriggerTick(Character* c, FrameCtx* f) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u3-renames.tsv (decomp D:\\nioh3-re\\decomp)'),
