    (0x23bf1c, 'function', 'ShapeComputeLocalBoundsAndBasis', 'ShapeComputeLocalBoundsAndBasis [medium] initialises an AABB to +/-7.7e17 (7722B3DBh / F722B3DBh) w=1, then accumulates node positions through Vec3CrossNormalizeBasis and Vec4MulMat44. LIVE: entered from 23B658 (tail call; return address 23B649 inside ShapeBoundsRefreshIfState1 23B62C - the nearest-symbol label VsmClipmapForceInvalidate was wrong); args confirm the +/-7.7e17 init, r8 = a world position (1277, 1300, 576), [r9] = 500000.0; ~5 per rendered frame (530-580/s in play) | src: notes/session-2026-10-08-perf.md s3 (FnProbe live, captures/playsession/20261008-2059-session)'),
