    (0x5a6270, 'function', 'PooledStructAlloc_5A6270', 'PooledStructAlloc_5A6270 [low] allocates a 0x18-byte entry (tag 23h) from a static pool of 200h dwords or the pool allocator 5A6374 and initialises it with 5A62E4; callers 5A60A4, 5A6238 | src: notes/perf-coverage.md (perf-rename-4)'),
