    (0x5ab868, 'function', 'TickInputBlockCountdown', 'TickInputBlockCountdown [low] 210 B: latch 5AB8D4 (46D8340/46D8342); 10-tick countdown g_45BA254 forcing c+11Ch..+128h and c+214h = -1.0f (227DE3C / 227DF5C toggles) | sig: void TickInputBlockCountdown(Ctx* c) | src: notes/gamelogic.md'),
    (0x5ab8a0, 'function', 'LandscapeLightestFlagsApply', 'LandscapeLightestFlagsApply [medium] from UpdateDispatchB: at g_CfgLandscapeQuality == 0 clears bit 1 of [o+28h]+48h and, when 5AB8D4 allows, clears flag bits 0/1/2/14/16 of [o+28h] (LIGHTEST-only landscape features) | sig: void LandscapeLightestFlagsApply(ptr o) | src: notes/gpu-maxsettings.md §LANDSCAPE_QUALITY; notes/perf-coverage.md'),
    (0x5ab8d4, 'function', 'GlobalFlagPair46D8340_TestAndClear', 'GlobalFlagPair46D8340_TestAndClear [medium] returns g[0x46D8340] or g[0x46D8342] set, then clears 0x46D8342 (one-shot latch); callers EffectManagerUpdate*, TickInputBlockCountdown (decompile-verified, cpu100-u1) (was Unknown_Effect_5ab8d4) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u1-renames.tsv'),
