    (0x5ad6aa, 'label', 'VrrScale_P2', 'VrrScale_P2 [high] Nioh3EngineFix id P2 group VRR len 8 orig F3 0F 11 97 24 06 00 00 (movss [rdi+624h],xmm2) -> call caveScale + 0F 1F 00; G[624]=G[628]*scaleCorr, feeds G[62C] accumulator (aka FrameTimingPatchP2, ExtPatchSite_5AD6AA) || also: frame-timing patch P2 site (ft_vrr), disassembled by review_sites.fsx for flag/register reuse; listed in cpu_caves.fsx FT_SITES overlap check (see frame-timing notes for role) | src: mod/Nioh3EngineFix/patches.json; notes/frame-timing.md §5 P2; patcher/cpu_caves.fsx; patcher/review_sites.fsx; re/scripts_meshlet/meshlet_caves.fsx OTHER_SITES'),
