    (0x5af5c2, 'label', 'DynFpsGovernorTick_CommitTarget', "DynFpsGovernorTick_CommitTarget [high] Nioh3Fix site (dynamic-FPS setting): mov [r8+0x60],r11d resets StepUpCounter just before the target is published to GameMain+0x618 (aka DynFps_TargetSig) || also: Nioh3Fix sig #22 'Dynamic FPS target' start (45 89 .. 48 8B ..) | src: re/out/anchors.md §site 0x5af5c2; notes/frame-timing.md §3; notes/nioh3fix-signatures.md"),
    (0x5af5d2, 'label', 'DynFps_StoreTarget', 'DynFps_StoreTarget [high] mov [rcx+618h],eax writes dynamic tier to G[618]; Nioh3Fix DynamicFPS mid-hook (sig+0x10) sets target=clamp(1000/[r8+0x74],30,500) (CPU-time based, overestimates when GPU-bound) (aka DynFpsGovernorTick_StoreRequestedFps) || also: mov [rcx+0x618],eax publishes governor target to GameMain.RequestedFps (guarded by g_pGameMain != 0) | src: notes/frame-timing.md §0, §3; notes/fps-unlock-research.md §1; re/out/anchors.md §site 0x5af5c2'),
    (0x5af604, 'function', 'GetRenFpsCap', 'GetRenFpsCap [high] REN_FPS cap = {30,60,120}[g_CfgRenFps]; out-of-range clamps to first option; no 144/uncapped option exists (aka GetTargetFps) || also: Returns {30,60,120}[REN_FPS idx 0x45BAF54]; no online condition; left unpatched in >120 design A | Returns {30,60,120}[REN_FPS slot]; out-of-range clamps to first option | sig: uint GetRenFpsCap(void) | src: re/out/README.md §Findings: frame pacing; §Findings: config.xml; notes/frame-timing.md §3, §9.1; re/out/README.md §frame pacing'),
