    (0xac7d30, 'function', 'NavSearchInvokeExpandCallback', 'NavSearchInvokeExpandCallback [medium] 846 B; callers NavOpenListPopExpand and Unknown_ResolveSignedArg_AC8580; returns unless graph callback [s+10h]+860h is set; resolves up to 4 vertex position pointers (edge table +58h stride 20h -> poly +40h stride 24h -> vertex index +48h stride 1Ch -> positions +78h * [+18h]+44h) for the current/neighbour edges and invokes the callback with them (visit/debug hook of the graph search) (was Unknown_Resource_ac7d30) | sig: void NavSearchInvokeExpandCallback(NavSearch *s, int node, char side, int nbr, char nbrSide) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u3-renames.tsv (decomp D:\\nioh3-re\\decomp)'),
    (0xac8580, 'function', 'NavSearchEvalNeighborCost', 'NavSearchEvalNeighborCost [low] A* helper next to NavOpenListPopExpand: computes the travel cost from node param_3 to param_4 (edge records 14h stride at +68h, nodes 20h at +58h, FLT_MAX when blocked), optional heuristic callback +850h, then updates the open list record (cpu100-u0, decompile-read) (was Unknown_ResolveSignedArg_AC8580) | sig: void NavSearchEvalNeighborCost(void) | src: decomp D:/nioh3-re/decomp + callers/callees/neighbours in symbols.tsv (cpu100-u0)'),
    (0xac8d10, 'function', 'NavOpenListPopExpand', 'NavOpenListPopExpand [low] pops one entry from a swap-remove list (ctx+30h/38h), marks record (ctx+18h, stride 10h), looks up cost slot via ctx+10h/58h tables and neighbour ids (stride 24h), compares costs / FLT_MAX, may call AC8580; graph-search step; sole caller AC98C0; 683 B | sig: bool(ctx*) | src: notes/cleanup-decompile-db.md'),
    (0xac9960, 'function', 'GraphSearchInitFromStart', 'GraphSearchInitFromStart [medium] virtual (vtable 3911D50): stores graph, resets every 16-byte node record (cost 0, best FLT_MAX, parent -1, flag 0xFF), seeds the start node (graph+0x60) with cost 0, clears +0x38 and pushes it to the open heap (BF328) - Dijkstra/A* init (was Unknown_LoopHelper_ac9960) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u2-renames.tsv (decomp review)'),
