    (0x1a76d68, 'function', 'PeriodicListenerThreadLoop', "PeriodicListenerThreadLoop [medium] thread body (no static callers): under lock calls each listener's vfunc 0 once, then while o+8 runs: lock o+0x28, calls listener->vfunc+8(o+9 == 0 && o+0xA) for every listener, unlocks, Sleep(o+0xC ms) (was Unknown_LoopHelper_1a76d68) | src: re/symbols/incoming/cpu100-u2-renames.tsv (decomp review)"),
