    (0x1fde3e8, 'function', 'SetRenderRatioIndex', 'SetRenderRatioIndex [high] Sets REN_RAT (idx 8, 0x45baf50) and g_RenderRatioValue; when RESOLUTION_SCALING==1 (DLSS) clamps idx to 2 or 5; g_RenderResolution = 0x39783d0[0x39787b0[SCR_REZ*16+idx]]; syncs DYNAMIC_RENDER_RATIO_MAX. README calls it a getter on REN_REZ (idx 7) (aka SetRenRat) || also: README: small getter on SCR_REZ/REN_REZ tables (resolution anchor); but live_refs + apply show it writes the REN_RAT slot from SCR_REZ/DYN_RATIO_MAX/RESOLUTION_SCALING (apply passes REN_RAT) - likely a setter/clamp | sig: void SetRenderRatioIndex(int renRatIdx) | src: re/out/anchors.md §site 0x1fde43e; re/out/README.md §camera/FOV/resolution; re/settings/live_refs.txt; re/settings/saveapply.asm'),
