    (0x1fe14cc, 'function', 'GetConfigDesc', 'GetConfigDesc [high] Returns &g_ConfigDescTable[idx] (null if idx>59); first call statically builds the 60-entry descriptor table (magic static); callers 0xae0bc0, 0xfb9a10, 0x1fe22f8, 0x1fe2314, 0x1fe3ff0, 0x1fe41a0, 0x1fe4244, 0x1fe5d8c (aka ConfigDescTableInit) || also: Builds g_ConfigDescTable once (3625 B, 8 callers); sole referencer of all key strings | sig: ConfigDesc* GetConfigDesc(int idx) | src: re/out/README.md §config.xml; notes/settings.md §1; re/settings/cfgfunc.asm + xref1.txt; re/out/README.md §Findings: config.xml'),
