    (0x1fe2fd4, 'function', 'SizeWorkerPools', "SizeWorkerPools [high] sizes the engine's 74 worker pools once at boot from the logical CPU count (clamped 6..32); with <13 logical CPUs it takes 3 threads from pool 3 (KIDS_RESOURCE) and pool 5 (StageUpdate) [Ghidra: 357 B, 1 callers] (aka SizeThreadPools) || also: Worker count = clamp(logical,6,32) (12 here), sizes 74 named pools from g_ThreadPoolTable 0x4b722d0; <=12 logical CPUs -> KIDS_RESOURCE and StageUpdate lose 3 threads each (P12 patch lifts it, no fps gain) | src: patcher/pool_patch.fsx; notes/settings.md §4.3; README.md §Second round"),
    (0x1fe300b, 'label', 'SizeWorkerPools_BaseClampCmp', 'SizeWorkerPools_BaseClampCmp [high] WC (WorkerCap) site A: upper clamp of the logical count -> imm8 = cap | sig: cmp r11d,20h | src: notes/job-system.md §2c; re/scripts_jobs/jobs_live.fsx'),
    (0x1fe3011, 'label', 'SizeWorkerPools_BaseClampMov', 'SizeWorkerPools_BaseClampMov [high] WC (WorkerCap) site B: clamped value -> imm8 = cap (write before site A) | sig: mov al,20h | src: notes/job-system.md §2c; re/scripts_jobs/jobs_live.fsx'),
    (0x1fe30d5, 'label', 'WorkerPoolSize_P12', 'WorkerPoolSize_P12 [high] Nioh3EngineFix id P12 group P12 len 4 orig 41 83 FB 0C (cmp r11d,12 hw threads) -> 41 83 FB 00; keeps KIDS_RESOURCE/StageUpdate pools from losing 3 threads on <=12-thread CPUs; must be written before pools are created (aka SizeWorkerPools_SmallCpuPenaltyCmp) || also: P12 patch site: `cmp r11d,0Ch` (41 83 FB 0C; r11d = logical CPU count) -> imm 00h so the <=12-CPU penalty never applies; must be written at boot after SteamStub decrypts .text | src: mod/Nioh3EngineFix/patches.json; mod/Nioh3EngineFix/README.md; patcher/pool_patch.fsx'),
    (0x1fe30d9, 'label', 'SizeWorkerPools_SkipPenalty', 'SizeWorkerPools_SkipPenalty [high] `jg skip-penalty` (7F 2B) after the CPU-count compare | src: patcher/pool_patch.fsx'),
