    (0x1fe41a0, 'function', 'LoadConfig', 'LoadConfig [high] Loads config.xml: calls ReadConfigKey 0x1fe4244 per key then ApplyConfig 0x1fe6064; called from AppInit 0x298d6c8 | sig: void LoadConfig() | src: notes/settings.md §1; re/settings/acc.asm'),
    (0x1fe4244, 'function', 'ReadConfigKey', 'ReadConfigKey [high] Reads one key via XPath "//%s/text()" from %LOCALAPPDATA%\\KoeiTecmo\\NIOH3\\config.xml; enum keys = exact case-sensitive strcmp vs option list, int keys = atoi + min/max check; missing/invalid -> default (aka ConfigXmlRead) || also: config.xml reader using XPath "//%s/text()" under root "settings" (README lists reader/writer pair 0x1fe4244/0x1fe5d8c without saying which is which; order assumed) | src: re/out/README.md §config.xml; notes/settings.md §1; re/out/README.md §Findings: config.xml'),
