    (0x34837dc, 'function', 'PsoListResolveGfx', "PsoListResolveGfx [high] resolves the shader slots of one 0x80-byte PSO-list record: each slot = {u32 shader-group file id, u32 index}, FFFFFFFFh = none, 56CB1360h = built-in system shaders; returns 1 when a slot's group is not loaded (record skipped, list marked incomplete), 0 = ready to preload | sig: int PsoListResolveGfx(void* ctx, void* groups, u64* rec, void* map1, void* map2) | src: notes/stutter.md §3.1"),
